From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pw4-port <pw4-port@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:58:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] PW4 Android: remove the USB plug freeze diagnostics

Revert the trace and switch patches (busfreq, cpufreq, cpuidle, USB runtime
PM, pull-up, PMIC dump) and drop the register watcher. Keep the bounded UDC
busy waits and the gated-register guard without traces; the lockup detector
stays, off unless pw4_lockup=1.
